      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know what to do anymore. everything is just... gone. the bank called again today and i cant even look at my phone. i lost everything in the collapse and i'm so far in the hole i can't even see the top. i feel like such a failure. i just want everything to stop. i just want the noise and the panic to stop.",
