      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are using the business metaphor because the financial disaster feels like a fatal, unsolvable problem, and that logic feels incredibly powerful right now. However, your life and your value are not quantifiable by debt, and there are ways to navigate these overwhelming crises without ending your journey. Please consider speaking with a mental health professional who can help you separate the business failure from your personal worth. Call or text 988 immediately to talk through this intense feeling of having no way out.",
